          "text": "```java\npublic void testForID_String_old() {\n    DateTimeZone zone = DateTimeZone.forID(\"MET\");\n\n    // MET is Middle European Time, not Asia/Tehran.\n    long winter = new DateTime(2010, 1, 15, 12, 0, DateTimeZone.UTC).getMillis();\n    long summer = new DateTime(2010, 7, 15, 12, 0, DateTimeZone.UTC).getMillis();\n\n    assertEquals(\"MET must have a standard offset of UTC+01:00\",\n            60 * 60 * 1000, zone.getStandardOffset(winter));\n    assertEquals(\"MET must use UTC+01:00 in winter\",\n            60 * 60 * 1000, zone.getOffset(winter));\n    assertEquals(\"MET must use UTC+02:00 during European daylight saving time\",\n            2 * 60 * 60 * 1000, zone.getOffset(summer));\n}\n```"
        }
